{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_16","type":"agent_message","text":"The earlier macro paths do reproduce useful partial progress: all three `8`s can be staged as a vertical train at rows 10/16/22, and all three `9`s as a horizontal train at columns 14/20/26. Crucially, exact geometry alone does not trigger reward; the probes show blocks can be geometrically aligned yet detached from the intended tether. I’m testing the remaining attachment/ownership condition rather than optimizing those coordinates blindly."}}
